WEBVTT

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:32.726
Look, there's good reason
to value authenticity.

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:34.905
Evidence shows that when
you have the freedom

00:04:34.929 --> 00:04:36.834
to express your thoughts and emotions,

00:04:36.858 --> 00:04:39.758
your energy soars
and so does your effectiveness.

00:04:39.782 --> 00:04:42.336
And when you feel
you can't be authentic at work,

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:45.466
you're more likely to become
stressed and exhausted.

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:47.176
It can be stifling.

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:49.386
If you're an entrepreneur
pitching a start-up

00:04:49.410 --> 00:04:51.936
or a job candidate pitching yourself,

00:04:51.960 --> 00:04:54.726
pretending to be who you think
others want you to be

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:57.615
can make you anxious
and hurt your performance.

00:04:58.240 --> 00:04:59.646
You do want to work somewhere

00:04:59.670 --> 00:05:01.836
that accepts your authentic self.